Phase 1: Business Discovery (First 30 Minutes)
Start with business questions.
Company Overview
Ask:

Tell me about your business.

What products do you sell?

How long have you been operating?

Online only or online + physical store?

Who are your customers?


Business Process
Ask:

How do customers place orders today?

What happens after an order is placed?

How do you manage inventory?

How do you handle deliveries?

How do you manage customer support?

Draw the workflow.
